(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-web/src/hydrate.asl#" :text "Zero-Cost Client-Side WebAssembly Hydration and VNode Parity Verifier")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-web/src/proxy.asl#" :text "Pure AgentSlang Binary PROXY Protocol v2 Parser and Reverse Proxy Header Middleware")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-web/src/sse.asl#" :text "Pure AgentSlang Server-Sent Events Formatting, Streaming, and Parsing Pipeline")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-web/src/ssr.asl#" :text "Pure AgentSlang Streaming Server-Side Rendering and RFC 9112 Chunked HTML Pipeline")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-web/src/ws.asl#" :text "Pure AgentSlang RFC 6455 WebSocket Framing, Masking, and Validation Engine")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-web/tests/fixtures/handoffProgram.asl#" :text "Native program proxyV2Test builds with asl1 and runs: a Unix listener handed over an asl-net/handoff channel keeps accepting after its first descriptor is closed, and each handoff error has its contract text. Prints one line per check, ok or FAIL with the evidence; exits 0 only when every check holds. asl-host cannot load it (asl-net/handoff is native only).")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-web/tests/fixtures/handoffProgram.asl#echo" :text "Connects to path, accepts on listener, writes ping and reads it back: the text read, or the first err.")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-web/tests/fixtures/handoffProgram.asl#roundTrip" :text "Hands server over a fresh channel, adopts the received descriptor, closes server's own (keeping its path) and echoes through the adopted one.")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-web/tests/fixtures/handoffProgram.asl#errorContracts" :text "The contract texts: a closed server is refused before any send, a bad channel fails the send or receive with the errno, a channel whose sender closed carries no descriptor, and a path that is not a socket is refused with the received descriptor closed.")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-web/tests/fixtures/handoffProgram.asl#main" :text "Runs the checks with the socket at <dir>/proxy.sock, dir the first argument.")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-web/tests/hydrationTest.asl#" :text "Acceptance gate for Task 53804: Streaming SSR & Zero-Cost WASM Hydration via Compact ASN Payloads under ADR D81 and D77")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-web/tests/proxyV2Test.asl#" :text "Acceptance gate for Task 53803: Nginx Reverse Proxy Bridge, Unix Domain Sockets & PROXY Protocol v2 under ADR D81 and D77; the listener handoff runs natively (FDHANDOFF)")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-web/tests/proxyV2Test.asl#handoffLines" :text "The lines handoffProgram prints when every check holds, in its order.")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-web/tests/proxyV2Test.asl#testUnixDomainSocketServer!" :text "Unix socket config and listen contracts on asl-host, then the listener handoff (asl-net/handoff, native only: asl-host has no unixSocketPair, sockSendFd or sockRecvFd) as tests/fixtures/handoffProgram built by asl1, linked against libaslrt.a and run in a fresh directory: it must print every handoffLines line and exit 0.")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-web/tests/ssrTest.asl#" :text "Popperian verification suite for isomorphic SSR document generation and zero-shift hydration")
